# Oaza Spokoju — AI Architecture Copilot

## Project overview
Next.js dashboard for the "Oaza Spokoju" house project in Cieszyn, Poland. Chat uses **Cursor SDK** with **Composer 2.5** agent (plan mode) — full project context injected via prompt.

## Tech stack
- **Framework:** Next.js 15 (App Router, TypeScript)
- **AI:** Cursor SDK (`@cursor/sdk`) — Composer 2.5, `mode: "plan"`
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4
- **Visualization:** SVG (floor plans), Three.js (3D — future)
- **Language:** TypeScript throughout

## Architecture

```
oaza-spokoju-app/
├── .env.local                    # CURSOR_API_KEY
├── src/
│   ├── app/api/chat/route.ts     # SSE streaming → Cursor SDK
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── cursor-agent.ts       # Agent session manager
│   │   ├── agent-prompt.ts       # Project context + action instructions
│   │   └── agent-actions.ts      # Parse [[ACTION:...]] blocks
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── Dashboard.tsx         # 3-panel layout + action handlers
│   │   ├── ChatPanel.tsx         # Custom streaming chat UI
│   │   ├── VisualizationPanel.tsx
│   │   ├── FloorPlanSVG.tsx
│   │   └── TopographyView.tsx
│   └── data/
│       ├── project-context.ts
│       └── rooms.ts
```

## Agent actions (UI control)

Agent emits blocks at end of response:
`[[ACTION:{"name":"showFloorPlan","params":{"floor":"parter"}}]]`

Available: `showFloorPlan`, `showPlotMap`, `showTopography`, `highlightRoom`

## Design direction
- Japandi / Biophilic — warm wood, muted greens
- Font: DM Sans + DM Serif Display
- Colors: #F5F0EB bg, #2D5016 accent
- Agent speaks Polish by default
